# Box-score CSVs are fetched fresh in CI on every run — they are build
# artifacts, not source. Keeping them out of git avoids bloating history
# (the play-by-play file is ~13 MB and would churn daily).
*.csv

# Reference / scratch files that don't belong in the deployable repo
*.xlsx
.Rhistory
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Private product/strategy docs — keep out of the public repo
COLUMN-REDESIGN.*
WNBA-STATS-EXPLORER.md
CLAUDE.md
Product Archive/

# Daily Bluesky engagement briefs (generated by the bluesky-brief skill) —
# personal working notes, not site source
bluesky-briefs/

# Work-in-progress prototypes — anything with "prototype" in the name
*prototype*

# Cloudflare Workers — local build cache and local secrets, never committed.
#
# THE RULE: every Worker's SOURCE (worker.js + wrangler.toml) is tracked.
# Only the build cache and local secret files below are ignored. Secrets live
# solely in `wrangler secret put` — never in wrangler.toml, since this repo is
# public.
#
# Workers in this repo:
#   cron-worker/       tracked since 2026-07  (deployed — build dispatch + health checks)
#   analytics-worker/  tracked since 2026-08-05 (deployed — usage beacon)
#   espn-proxy/        tracked since 2026-08-05 (NOT deployed — contingency only)
#
# analytics-worker/ sat untracked from 2026-07-12 to 2026-08-05: nothing was
# ignoring it (`git check-ignore` exits 1), it was just never `git add`ed,
# because this note used to name cron-worker alone and read as if the policy
# were specific to it. Hence the explicit list — add to it when you add a Worker.
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# Local secrets for usage_report.py (CF_ACCOUNT_ID / CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN).
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC — never commit a token. In CI these come from repo
# secrets instead, so .env is a local-only convenience.
.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# macOS
.DS_Store
wnba_linescores_2026.json

# Ephemeral payload for the Bluesky auto-post — regenerated every build
social_payload.json

# Build/fetch artifacts — regenerated every run, never source
WNBA-2026-stats-explorer.html
wnba_schedule_today.json

# Local scratch
temp downloads/
.claude/
